{"pageid":5167,"title":"Alien communication device","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Alien communication device</span>","revid":22084,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 340px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/Alien_Communication_Device.png/revision/latest?cb=20260614062205\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alien Communication Device\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8c/Alien_Communication_Device.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/340?cb=20260614062205\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"340\" height=\"286\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alien Communication Device.png\" data-image-key=\"Alien_Communication_Device.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alien_Communication_Device.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alien_Communication_Device\"><b>Alien Communication Device</b></span></h2>\n<p><i>\"A rare device that sends a remote call to the aliens. Be careful, they're not very friendly! Has a cool down of 1 hour, and consumes 300 energy on use. Must be recharged at an Energy Vault.\"</i>\n</p><p>As said, this device needs to be charged with 300 energy after each use. Spawns <span class=\"new\" title=\"Alien crash site (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWxpZW5fY3Jhc2hfc2l0ZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">alien crash site</span>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Method_of_Obtainment\">Method of Obtainment</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 329px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e3/Alien_orb_quest.png/revision/latest?cb=20260614063002\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Alien orb quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e3/Alien_orb_quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/329?cb=20260614063002\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"329\" height=\"190\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Alien orb quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Alien_orb_quest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Alien_orb_quest.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>You will receive the device after completing the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Alien Orb Quest (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWxpZW5fT3JiX1F1ZXN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Alien orb quest</span> and can only be given by such. To obtain the Alien Communication Device you must find and enter the Alien Ruins and speak to Alan Burk's Hologram. After obtaining the quest, locate the three missing alien orbs and return them to their pedestals. After you finish this quest you will obtain the Alien Communication Device with one use already loaded onto it.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903033225\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5167-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903033225 and revision id 22084. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Alien crash site","exists":false},{"title":"Alien Orb Quest","exists":false}],"images":["Alien_Communication_Device.png","Alien_orb_quest.png"]}
